[1m[38;5;231mHow should other forms declare and access preferences?[0m

[38;5;153m❯[39m [38;5;246m1.[39m [38;5;153mDeclared schema (Recommended)[39m
     [38;5;246mEach preference registered with key, default, and validator. Reads always return a valid value; unknown keys throw.
[39m  [38;5;246m2.[39m Open key-value bag
     [38;5;246mFree-form get/set. Maximum flexibility, no defaults or validation, collisions possible between forms.[39m
  [38;5;246m3.[39m Schema + namespaces
     [38;5;246mPer-form preference groups on top of a declared schema. Collision-safe, more machinery than v1 needs.[39m
